{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的音乐感受描写不如X细腻，尤其缺少随具体乐句出现的细微变化，部分音乐起伏被概括成了情绪标签。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更适合普通观众边听边扫：左侧完整叙事把人物的想法、顾虑和行为连成因果，右侧感受词负责补充体验，阅读路径比较稳定，也更容易理解每段究竟发生了什么。X的加亮关键词和随音乐到时出现的感受非常有价值，尤其在音乐细节、情绪转折和身体感受上明显更细腻，但碎片较多，容易让注意力在故事和感受之间反复切换。综合实际观看体验，我选Y，但X在细腻度上确实胜出。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f2a799da-8d0b-457b-b0c3-cbafb5d4f9b2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T000841035689Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:10:06.647293+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5cef3ff7e4a0f14e9b6095887fe5ee6b6aeb2006c34f4f06ad9589a9988cb5d0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme